  "title": "Market Sentiment → Volatility Prediction (NLP-free approach)",
  "model": "Regression with market-derived sentiment proxies",
  "description": "Tests whether market-derived sentiment indicators (VIX surprise z-score, VIX term structure slope, SKEW index, composite fear) contain incremental information for predicting future realized volatility beyond what GJR-GARCH and VIX level already capture. Uses Newey-West HAC inference, rolling OOS evaluation, DM tests, and Granger causality.",
